        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6b63de34255d4228b265323a8e27f79d",
      "statement": "Rust prepare still runs with an embedder when SimpleTokenizer and SimpleSegmenter are in use; the embedding index is built on the prepared candidates and the 0.3.x skip of Rust prepare on the embedder path is gone.",
